@startuml
title Authentication Account vs Actor Deactivation

state "Authentication Account ACTIVE" as AccountActive
state "Authentication Account INACTIVE" as AccountInactive

state "Tenant A Actor ACTIVE" as ActorAActive
state "Tenant A Actor INACTIVE" as ActorAInactive

state "Tenant B Actor ACTIVE" as ActorBActive

AccountActive --> AccountInactive : deactivate Account
AccountInactive --> AccountActive : reactivate Account

ActorAActive --> ActorAInactive : deactivate Actor A
ActorAInactive --> ActorAActive : reactivate Actor A

note right of AccountInactive
Cannot authenticate anywhere.

All tenant contexts unavailable.

Sessions should be revoked.
end note

note right of ActorAInactive
Authentication Account still works.

Tenant B can remain accessible.

Only Tenant A becomes unavailable.
end note

ActorBActive -[hidden]-> ActorAActive

@enduml